    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "The four games follow a loon's year. Nest Site is spring: choose where to nest along the shoreline. Deep Dive is summer: dive to feed chicks as the water gets cloudier. Runway is fall: a loon needs up to a quarter mile of open water to take off. And Chick Taxi is a simple game for the youngest visitors.",
